{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "2月13日，0点1分。", "text_idx": 157, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "交往两个月的纪念日过了以后，\\n纱凪也还没有回来。", "text_idx": 158, "plain": "交往两个月的纪念日过了以后，纱凪也还没有回来。", "plain_idx": 159, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便如此，我也不想离开这里。", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我已经习惯了不看时钟。", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……咦，是新吾吗？」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3382", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "黑暗中传来了声音。", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我立刻就知道了那是谁。", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐？」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "回头望向声音传来的方向，熟悉的笑容映入眼帘。", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，果然是新吾啊。\\n　怎么了吗，都这个时间了……」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": "「呵呵，果然是新吾啊。　怎么了吗，都这个时间了……」", "plain_idx": 171, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3383", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐才是，有什么事吗？」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、嗯。我想看一眼活动室，\\n　顺便找找小熊喵……」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": "「啊、嗯。我想看一眼活动室，　顺便找找小熊喵……」", "plain_idx": 175, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3384", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说起来有类似熊喵的生物的目击情报就是从这附近传出来的啊。", "text_idx": 177, "plain": "说起来有类似熊喵的生物的目击情报就是从这附近传出来的啊。", "plain_idx": 177, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "果然学姐也很在意的样子。", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话说回来，\\n学姐这个时间点还去看活动室了吗。", "text_idx": 179, "plain": "话说回来，学姐这个时间点还去看活动室了吗。", "plain_idx": 180, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起学姐，我却……", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾有什么事吗？\\n　啊……那里是纱纱的家吧」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": "「新吾有什么事吗？　啊……那里是纱纱的家吧」", "plain_idx": 183, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3385", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3386", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「发生什么了吗？」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3387", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还想蒙混过关，结果却被识破了。", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果新吾愿意的话，\\n　我想听听发生了什么哦」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": "「如果新吾愿意的话，　我想听听发生了什么哦」", "plain_idx": 191, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3388", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你想，我也算是比你大一岁的人生学姐嘛」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3389", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐踮起脚尖对我微笑。", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐……」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真是个不可思议的人。", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是这样说着，我的心情一下子就轻松了。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "无论如何都会变得毫无防备。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这样啊。原来发生了这种事啊」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3390", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐一直保持着微笑听我说话。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以说实话，我全招了。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我是真心喜欢纱凪。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正因为如此，才会给自己戴上枷锁。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连男人的责任都承担不了的现在的自己，\\n要追求纱凪到什么程度才好呢，而那样会被允许吗?", "text_idx": 206, "plain": "连男人的责任都承担不了的现在的自己，要追求纱凪到什么程度才好呢，而那样会被允许吗?", "plain_idx": 207, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说着说着，心里越来越激动。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好像听到了纱凪的声音。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我是真心喜欢纱凪的」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后除了这句话，什么也说不出口。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3391", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？！」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐踮起脚尖，\\n温柔地摸了摸我的头。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": "美羽学姐踮起脚尖，温柔地摸了摸我的头。", "plain_idx": 215, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个动作和纱凪有几分相似。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾真的很珍惜纱纱啊」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": "「新吾真的很珍惜纱纱啊」", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3392", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐的笑容让人感觉仿佛置身于阳光之下。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": "美羽学姐的笑容让人感觉仿佛置身于阳光之下。", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我点了点头，攥紧了自己的胸口。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想纱纱一定也是知道的哦?」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3393", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以我觉得新吾没有错」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3394", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐……」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐微微一笑，转过身去。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那个背影真令人怀念。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这是纱凪很尊敬的女性。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那是两个人想要接近而不断追逐着的背影。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我啊，\\n　以前就有想对纱纱说的话」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": "「我啊，　以前就有想对纱纱说的话」", "plain_idx": 230, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3395", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对纱凪？」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。她从很早以前就对自己没有自信」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "「嗯。她从很早以前就对自己没有自信」", "plain_idx": 233, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3396", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她总是说想成为像我一样的女生」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3397", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在也偶尔会听到。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想在她心里学姐就是如此重要的存在，因此接受了。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但那是不对的」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3398", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐像是征求我的同意似的转过头来。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她没有必要变成我这样」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3399", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想说，纱纱就是纱纱。\\n　我想对她说，她是很棒的」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "「我想说，纱纱就是纱纱。　我想对她说，她是很棒的」", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3400", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，你也这样告诉过纱纱，对吗？」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": "「新吾，你也这样告诉过纱纱，对吗？」", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3401", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我也不知道有没有告诉她这些」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「其实我觉得纱凪现在也很崇拜美羽学姐」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但有一件事我想她是明白的」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只有一件事让我很骄傲。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就是我喜欢的女孩是乾纱凪，不是其他任何人」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": "「那就是我喜欢的女孩是乾纱凪，不是其他任何人」", "plain_idx": 253, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3402", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵。新吾，你一定会成为很棒的丈夫吧」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3403", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然，纱纱也会成为很棒的妻子♪」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3404", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐就像在说自己的事情一样高兴地说道。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我很想告诉纱凪这件事。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，抱歉。耽误了你这么久陪我聊天……」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3405", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我才应该抱歉」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你还要在这里等着纱纱吗？」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3406", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想了一下，摇了摇头。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天就先回去了。\\n　可不能耽误了照顾动物的活啊」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "「今天就先回去了。　可不能耽误了照顾动物的活啊」", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这种时候休息一下也可以哦～？」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3407", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我觉得纱凪不会允许我这么做的」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是忙于恋爱，忽视了照顾动物，\\n那就本末倒置了。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": "要是忙于恋爱，忽视了照顾动物，那就本末倒置了。", "plain_idx": 273, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一定要做好收尾工作才行。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，我现在也可以去活动室吗?」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不用，没关系的」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3408", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对了。新吾，明天的社团活动，\\n　可以请你上午到活动室来吗?」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "「对了。新吾，明天的社团活动，　可以请你上午到活动室来吗?」", "plain_idx": 279, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3409", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，好的。是和谁换班吗？」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。我明天的打工时间改到上午了」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3410", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以我想，要是新吾能代替我就好了」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3411", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明白了。那我明天就换到上午的时间了」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，谢谢～\\n　回家路上要小心哦」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": "「嗯，谢谢～　回家路上要小心哦」", "plain_idx": 288, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3412", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的，学姐也是」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "本来想一起走到公园的，\\n但是学姐似乎是在关心纱凪。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": "本来想一起走到公园的，但是学姐似乎是在关心纱凪。", "plain_idx": 292, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明天的社团活动时间和纱凪错开了。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……总之，必须尽快和好才行。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔～好冷好冷……\\n　总之活动室里的小动物们都检查过了……」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": "「唔～好冷好冷……　总之活动室里的小动物们都检查过了……」", "plain_idx": 297, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4991", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱纱，辛苦了」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3413", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，美羽学姐……」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4992", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你果然来看大家的情况了呢」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3414", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然？」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4993", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，没什么哦。\\n　对了，纱纱。你知道明天是什么日子吗？」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "「不，没什么哦。　对了，纱纱。你知道明天是什么日子吗？」", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3415", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天吗？\\n　那个，情人节……对吧」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": "「明天吗？　那个，情人节……对吧」", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4994", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。你会给新吾巧克力吧?」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": "「嗯。你会给新吾巧克力吧?」", "plain_idx": 313, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3416", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，那个，我……那个……」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4995", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「方便的话，和我一起做巧克力吧？」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3417", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸，和学姐一起吗？」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4996", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，要是交到男朋友的话，\\n　果然还是亲手做的巧克力比较好呢♪」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": "「嗯，要是交到男朋友的话，　果然还是亲手做的巧克力比较好呢♪」", "plain_idx": 322, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3418", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但、但是……」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4997", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
